th your tickets including a mouthwatering selection of snacks and beverages.\"\n        },\n        \"host_name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"ANÄNA\"\n        },\n        \"is_coming_soon\": {\n          \"booleanValue\": false\n        },\n        \"film_reference\": {\n          \"referenceValue\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/films/0HUk5j8jVk4M0bjiSfou\"\n        },\n        \"film_name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"FACES PLACES\"\n        },\n        \"total_capacity\": {\n          \"integerValue\": \"16\"\n        },\n        \"ticket_availability\": {\n          \"integerValue\": \"10\"\n        },\n        \"name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"CAFÉ CINEMA PARADISO AT ANANA\"\n        },\n        \"event_date\": {\n          \"timestampValue\": \"2024-01-24T17:30:00.739Z\"\n        },\n        \"venue_reference\": {\n          \"referenceValue\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/venues/Suc6tdp89KcmEmCW0SuU\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"createTime\": \"2024-01-18T15:19:57.625343Z\",\n      \"updateTime\": \"2024-05-29T18:55:52.732671Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/events/6ahuHpQGI2AECqaW4f1T\",\n      \"fields\": {\n        \"name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"CINEMA AT THE PLAY ROOM\"\n        },\n        \"end_time\": {\n          \"timestampValue\": \"2023-12-21T19:00:00Z\"\n        },\n        \"film_reference\": {\n          \"referenceValue\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/films/7pKD4M94xXgc2x3LJvkc\"\n        },\n        \"is_coming_soon\": {\n          \"booleanValue\": false\n        },\n        \"event_type\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"MOVIE SCREENING\"\n        },\n        \"description\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"Step into the heart of Athens this coming Thursday and join us for an enchanting social cinema experience at Dave's Play Room, one of Brown's trendiest boutiques. We can't wait to go on a memorable cinematic adventure with you at our inaugural Cinebur event, where luxurious hospitality, meaningful social interaction, and cultural novelty will all come together. So let's gather by the projector, indulge in our own homemade popcorn, and spark fantastic conversations. See you at the movies!\"\n        },\n        \"host_name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"Dave Red Athens\"\n        },\n        \"event_date\": {\n          \"timestampValue\": \"2023-12-21T17:00:00Z\"\n        },\n        \"total_capacity\": {\n          \"integerValue\": \"20\"\n        },\n        \"ticket_availability\": {\n          \"integerValue\": \"2\"\n        },\n        \"venue_reference\": {\n          \"referenceValue\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/venues/l1oig6vn2fF0THShXZd2\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"createTime\": \"2023-11-13T16:40:16.564015Z\",\n      \"updateTime\": \"2024-05-29T18:55:48.544063Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/events/6eoFnXIk16fcpq8AquNE\",\n      \"fields\": {\n        \"host_name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"The ‘Anama Concept\"\n        },\n        \"end_time\": {\n          \"timestampValue\": \"2024-10-11T18:45:00Z\"\n        },\n        \"name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"CUBAN NIGHT AT THE WINERY\"\n        },\n        \"film_reference\": {\n          \"referenceValue\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/films/FbQ8F4LTO4bZXeIquiuj\"\n        },\n        \"is_coming_soon\": {\n          \"booleanValue\": false\n        },\n        \"event_date\": {\n          \"timestampValue\": \"2024-10-11T17:00:00Z\"\n        },\n        \"ticket_availability\": {\n          \"doubleValue\": 0\n        },\n        \"description\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"We are looking forward to another event on Cinebur, and can't wait to welcome you to The ‘Anama Cellar. See you there!\"\n        },\n        \"film_name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"Buena Vista Social Club\"\n        },\n        \"event_type\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"MOVIE SCREENING\"\n        },\n        \"venue_reference\": {\n          \"referenceValue\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/venues/FuW56J5B5VB7R5Pb3s4q\"\n        },\n        \"total_capacity\": {\n          \"integerValue\": \"50\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"createTime\": \"2024-09-05T16:00:29.431727Z\",\n      \"updateTime\": \"2024-10-11T05:41:46.492895Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/events/9wNkpuCjIGZps7Zd7EES\",\n      \"fields\": {\n        \"is_coming_soon\": {\n          \"booleanValue\": false\n        },\n        \"entry_tickets\": {\n          \"arrayValue\": {\n            \"values\": [\n              {\n                \"mapValue\": {\n                  \"fields\": {\n                    \"capacity\": {\n                      \"integerValue\": \"10\"\n                    },\n                    \"current_availability\": {\n                      \"integerValue\": \"8\"\n                    },\n                    \"description\": {\n                      \"stringValue\": \"Entry to the event seated at the heart of our iconic courtyard. Come early to reserve a spot at one of our comfy sun-beds.\"\n                    },\n                    \"name\": {\n                      \"stringValue\": \"The Agora Moviegoer\"\n                    },\n                    \"price\": {\n                      \"doubleValue\": 10\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"event_date\": {\n          \"timestampValue\": \"2026-07-15T17:00:00Z\"\n        },\n        \"host_name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"The Agora Hotel\"\n        },\n        \"venue_reference\": {\n          \"referenceValue\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/venues/C9VS7nAWUcMWD0RTrmP0\"\n        },\n        \"name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"CINEMA NIGHT AT THE AGORA\"\n        },\n        \"event_type\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"MOVIE SCREENING\"\n        },\n        \"end_time\": {\n          \"timestampValue\": \"2026-07-15T19:12:00Z\"\n        },\n        \"total_capacity\": {\n          \"integerValue\": \"10\"\n        },\n        \"description\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"We are looking forward to another event on Cinebur, and can't wait to welcome you to The Agora Hotel. See you there!\"\n        },\n        \"film_name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"Call Me By Your Name\"\n        },\n        \"film_reference\": {\n          \"referenceValue\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/films/xXa0YZesTMxBf49tLBsH\"\n        },\n        \"ticket_availability\": {\n          \"integerValue\": \"8\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"createTime\": \"2026-06-17T08:12:05.967599Z\",\n      \"updateTime\": \"2026-07-15T06:43:11.952415Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/events/BCrcMNRlrhrP0Q75UAmf\",\n      \"fields\": {\n        \"event_type\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"Film Screening\"\n        },\n        \"end_time\": {\n          \"timestampValue\": \"2023-09-02T19:45:00Z\"\n        },\n        \"film_reference\": {\n          \"referenceValue\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/films/0weOXZQ656beTEytSrEw\"\n        },\n        \"venue_reference\": {\n          \"referenceValue\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/venues/S4f6n16uiEyRF2iDfrYe\"\n        },\n        \"name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"OPEN AIR CINEMA NIGHTS: EPISODE 1\"\n        },\n        \"host_name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"Home for Cooperation\"\n        },\n        \"total_capacity\": {\n          \"integerValue\": \"60\"\n        },\n        \"event_date\": {\n          \"timestampValue\": \"2023-09-02T17:45:00Z\"\n        },\n        \"description\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"Join us at the Home Café for an evening of film, warmth, and dialogue. We will begin the evening by showcasing “Divided Still”, a short film production by our own organization, the Home for Cooperation. After a 10-minute Q&A, we will continue with a showcase of “Hiroshima, mon Amour” (1959), one of the most celebrated cult classics of the French New Wave.\\n\\n“Divided Still” will begin screening at 8PM, while “Hiroshima, mon Amour” will be screened at 8:45PM.\"\n        },\n        \"ticket_availability\": {\n          \"integerValue\": \"42\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"createTime\": \"2023-08-24T14:31:23.558639Z\",\n      \"updateTime\": \"2024-05-29T18:55:44.461503Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/events/BhbXxYzPRHrM4RRLDmrx\",\n      \"fields\": {\n        \"entry_tickets\": {\n          \"arrayValue\": {\n            \"values\": [\n              {\n                \"mapValue\": {\n                  \"fields\": {\n                    \"capacity\": {\n                      \"integerValue\": \"40\"\n                    },\n                    \"current_availability\": {\n                      \"integerValue\": \"31\"\n                    },\n                    \"description\": {\n                      \"stringValue\": \"Standard ticket \"\n                    },\n                    \"name\": {\n                      \"stringValue\": \"Entrance \"\n                    },\n                    \"price\": {\n                      \"doubleValue\": 10\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"host_name\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"Dexamenes°°\"\n        },\n        \"film_reference\": {\n          \"referenceValue\": \"projects/cinebur-ltd/databases/(default)/documents/films/kQb9W7rsYPIcaKXoJASl\"\n        },\n        \"description\": {\n          \"stringValue\": \"We are looking forw